estigation.md`, starting at `TestCPUPlacementWholeCoreSMT`). At 23:11:40 the broker's teardown of SDN device `sdn-4bf7e75d` (Proxmox VM 111) timed out (`failed waiting for VM 111 deletion: context deadline exceeded`), but local bookkeeping was wiped as if the deletion succeeded, orphaning VM 111 on the Proxmox broker host. Every subsequent attempt to provision a fresh `sdn-4bf7e75d` collides with that still-present stale VM, and `TestLotsOfApps` is now the 10th consecutive test tonight to hit this exact signature. This is purely broker/Proxmox-side VM-lifecycle flakiness, not an EVE/pillar bug, and per `live-ledger.md` this exact \"deletion timeout → stale device blocks same-named recreation\" signature has no prior occurrence in past nightly runs — it's a new manifestation first seen tonight at 23:11:40, not a previously-documented recurring issue, and it will keep failing every remaining test in this suite until VM 111 is manually cleared on the Proxmox broker host.","time":{"start":1795212602000,"stop":1795212647410,"duration":45410}},{"uid":"1e470f52979be066","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/27/#testresult/1e470f52979be066","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795131965000,"stop":1795132244090,"duration":279090}},{"uid":"d5ab15562f5d8564","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/25/#testresult/d5ab15562f5d8564","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795039947000,"stop":1795040706060,"duration":759060}},{"uid":"bdfecf6346c3de7b","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/23/#testresult/bdfecf6346c3de7b","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794953131000,"stop":1794953371710,"duration":240710}},{"uid":"b7ece4b8eac65b0b","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/21/#testresult/b7ece4b8eac65b0b","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794868871000,"stop":1794869125180,"duration":254180}},{"uid":"15ae56749d74e95d","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/17/#testresult/15ae56749d74e